## Deliberately NOT absorbed: HackTricks (CC BY-NC 4.0)

The HackTricks project (https://github.com/HackTricks-wiki/hacktricks) is
licensed CC BY-NC 4.0, whose NonCommercial term forbids commercial use of the
licensed material. Its corpus is deliberately NOT absorbed into this package and
MUST NOT be: no HackTricks text, checklist, or payload list is copied,
transformed, or regenerated into `data/` here, and nothing in this package is
derived from it. The decision is deliberate and not an oversight of an
available source.

To be precise about what exists upstream at the pin: PayloadsAllTheThings
carries no HackTricks corpus at all. What it does carry is 13 markdown
references that link out to `book.hacktricks.xyz` in the "References" sections
of its own documents (for example `Web Sockets/README.md`,
`SQL Injection/MSSQL Injection.md`, `File Inclusion/LFI-to-RCE.md`). Those are
URLs, not content, and no HackTricks material is redistributed through them.

## Scope of the redistribution

Every corpus file in `data/` is generated from the pinned commit above and read
from disk at runtime by `src/loader.ts`. Nothing in this package statically
imports or inlines a corpus into a TypeScript module.
